\f3\b \cf0 Decision: loop the middle of NCP's stack.
\f1\b0  This is the prelude 
\f4 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  recurrent block 
\f4 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  coda layout (Huginn, ETD and SMELT all found that looping the middle layers works best). It is the smallest possible change to NCP: keep NCP's 1B layout of 4 concept layers, and share and repeat the middle two.\
$$\\underbrace\{P\}
\f9\i \{\\text\{1 layer\}\}\\ \\to\\ \\underbrace\{B \\to B\}
\f1\i0 \{\\text\{2 layers, applied twice\}\}\\ \\to\\ \\underbrace\{C\}_\{\\text\{1 layer\}\}\\qquad \\text\{4 physical layers, 6 layer applications\}$$\
