\f3\b\fs36 \cf0 Caveats and gate\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Everything here is one seed, d = 64, synthetic in-context tasks, and the core in isolation. Whether z changes 
\f9\i language
\f1\i0  loss is untested; the XM paper suggests it will be roughly neutral for next-token prediction. 
\f3\b Gate for the M2:
\f1\b0  the XM arm must stay within 0.02 nats of K = 1 on language loss, and beat it on multimodal chunk prediction and on best-of-K accuracy.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

